+  /* RISC OS: ask VFPSupport (VFPSupport_Features 0, SWI &58EC8, PRM p706, which returns
+   * FPSID, MVFR0, MVFR1). Neon needs 32 doubleword registers (MVFR0 bits
+   * 0-3 = 2) and the Advanced SIMD integer instructions (MVFR1 bits 8-11).
+   * Without VFPSupport, or without Neon, the plain C code is used. */
+  {
